  "notes": {
    "ks20261013-caney-access": "The operator explicitly publishes nonmember rates. Its homepage closes the course to public play on Tuesdays and allows exceptions for leagues, tournaments and posted events; the Stay & Play page separately says daily opening. The Tuesday restriction is retained rather than promising unrestricted daily access. Course Statistics expressly identifies nine physical holes played using two nine-hole tee loops, so the eighteen-hole route is not counted as a second physical course. Source publication dates are not stated; observed October 13, 2026.",
    "ks20261013-ness-source": "The official Ness County Chamber recreation page explicitly identifies a nine-hole course open to the public. Its unnumbered Highway 283 location about four miles north of Ness City is retained here but is not promoted to a numbered course address. No independent operator website, county assignment, property point or arrival was verified. The page is undated; observation on October 13, 2026 does not guarantee live operation.",
    "ks20261013-cimarron-source": "The operator Fees page explicitly offers nonmember weekday and weekend/holiday play. The independent official Kansas Tourism profile identifies a nine-hole physical course; nine/eighteen-hole playing prices are not separate layouts. The operator homepage publishes 812 Golf Course Rd., Cimarron, KS 67835. Source publication dates are unknown; observed October 13, 2026. County, property location and arrival remain unverified."
  },
